  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "常微分方程",
    "sub_ename": "ORDINARY DIFFERENTIAL EQUATION",
    "describe_ch": "In sciences and engineering, mathematical models are developed to help the understanding of physical phenomena. These models often generate an equation that contains some derivatives of an unknown function. Such an equation is called a differential equation. If the function is a single-valued function and then its derivative is an ordinary derivative. The differential equation is hence  called  an ordinary differential equation (ODE). ODE course is a direct extension of calculus. So calculus is a perquisite course for ODE. ODE course provides basic training of solving some simple ODEs and understanding basic ODE theory. It involves 1st order equations, second and nth order linear equations, series solutions, solution by Laplace transform, system of linear equations.",
    "describe_eh": "In sciences and engineering, mathematical models are developed to help the understanding of physical phenomena. These models often generate an equation that contains some derivatives of an unknown function. Such an equation is called a differential equation. If the function is a single-valued function and then its derivative is an ordinary derivative. The differential equation is hence  called  an ordinary differential equation (ODE). ODE course is a direct extension of calculus. So calculus is a perquisite course for ODE. ODE course provides basic training of solving some simple ODEs and understanding basic ODE theory. It involves 1st order equations, second and nth order linear equations, series solutions, solution by Laplace transform, system of linear equations.",
